---
const aboutPhoto =
  "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570463662416-7d8e39fc67e2?auto=format&fit=crop&q=75";
const aboutSrcset = [600, 900, 1200]
  .map((width) => `${aboutPhoto}&w=${width} ${width}w`)
  .join(", ");

const stats = [
  { value: "12+", label: "Years on the road" },
  { value: "1k+", label: "Happy travelers" },
  // { value: "40+", label: "Destinations" },
  // { value: "4.9", label: "Average rating" },
];
---

<section id="about" class="bg-stone-950 py-24 text-white">
  <div
    class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-16 px-6 lg:grid-cols-2"
  >
    <div class="reveal overflow-hidden rounded-3xl">
      <img
        src={`${aboutPhoto}&w=1200`}
        srcset={aboutSrcset}
        sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 600px, (min-width: 1024px) 50vw, 100vw"
        alt="Leopard"
        loading="lazy"
        class="aspect-[4/5] h-full w-full object-cover sm:aspect-[4/3] lg:aspect-[4/5]"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <p
        class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-400"
      >
        About us
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-semibold sm:text-5xl">
        Born from a road trip that never really ended
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75">
        It all started in Uganda, when the Ebola outbreak brought uncertainty
        and kept most travelers away. That's when two people from different worlds 
        crossed paths and together set off to explore the country.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75">
        By the end of the trip, the two had become friends, with a shared idea:
        Abengo Tours, born to rebuild confidence in Uganda and show the world it
        is as welcoming as ever.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75">
        Today, every itinerary is scouted in person, every car is serviced by
        our own team, and every guest is treated like a friend joining the trip.
      </p>
      <dl class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {
          stats.map((stat) => (
            <div>
              <dt class="font-display text-6xl font-semibold text-brand-400">
                {stat.value}
              </dt>
              <dd class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/60">{stat.label}</dd>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
